title: Version 0.12.0
modified: 20261112224929000
modifier: Yannis Anthymidis

!! UX

* General re-arrangement of all the settings, which I now consider final (until we get [[drag and drop between zones in 5.5.0|https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/pull/9507]] -- //if// that is merged in)
* Ticklers have better recurrence logic.
* Tickler recurrence options are now configurable from the settings
* Contexts no longer jump due to the picker while contextualising, if you have the context page open separately
* Group by is no longer shown if there are no options to group by
* When adding a dependency, pressing <kbd>Enter</kbd> now creates the target tiddler if it does not exist

!! Priorities sub-plugin

* New plugin, letting you mark priorities with a simple A/B/C scheme and your own custom label for A/B/C.

!! Cosmetic

* Actions now come before Projects in the default Review sidebar configuration
* Select realms all/none now looks better on borderless (default) style.
* _GSD/Contacts_ dashboard improved, now featuring a way to filter by contacts e.g. if you have an upcoming meeting

!! Misc

* Slight re-arrangement of control panel meant very minor breaking change on cleanup timeout setting if modified (due to removing the word "core" from it)
* Several config keys renamed for clarity so they broke if you customised them
* Significant performance improvement as I trimmed down some filter runs, etc.